	(text "Bus pull-ups: 10k to 3.3 V always (the LSFs' B side), 2.2k switched by the co-processor (GPIO10–13, 16–19); the ±5 V rails into the ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 316.23 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7650bfb1-9bf7-5b91-bf05-f54d6555e364")
	)
	(text_box "GPIO2–9 = buses A–H (gusmanb CH1–8, 8-bit mode); GPIO0 → GPIO1 bridged (its trigger path).\nGPIO14 = the node's mark (TCA9534A P7); GPIO25 = LED; GPIO19…16, 13…10 = pull-up enables A…H (2.2k);\nGPIO40–43 = VREF 1–4 / 2; GPIO44 = +5V × 47/147; GPIO45 = 3.3 V − (3.3 + 5) × 47/147 from −5 V.\nRUN pulled up, BOOTSEL (QSPI_SS) through 1k: both held by the node (TCA9534A), open drain.\nCore regulator: L1 polarity dot towards VREG_LX; C32, C33, C34 and L1 as close as the Pico 2's."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 314.96 0)
